 "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you. How are you? I usually use a rack on the front or back of the bike. A seat bag is great for a few items, but anything heavy or bulky causes balance issues. A bag on the back of the bike takes up a lot of space and can affect handling, so I'd avoid it if you can. They can be, but they add a bit of weight near the back, which changes the bike's balance.",
